# Model artifacts and the VisDrone payload stay out of the repo: the dataset
# is ~2GB and (critically) AISKYEYE licenses VisDrone for research only, so it
# must never be distributed through this repository. Provenance hashes in
# `manifests/` are the auditable record instead.
data/
